  "apply_rules": [
    "A card is pinned when definition_source_primary is 'user' or the card has a manual_edit review event whose metadata action is not 'rebalance' (an edit, a chosen candidate, a restored candidate); a pinned card's meaning is never changed.",
    "A blank card applies any resolved result. Its primary candidate carries result.sourceType; result.dictionary, when present, is added unselected with its own sourceType.",
    "A card that already has a meaning changes only for contextStatus 'resolved' (sourceType llm_context); its schedule is not reset.",
    "A resolved llm_context result for a pinned card is stored as an unselected candidate.",
    "context_retry: 'none' for resolved, unresolved and no_context; 'soon' (15 minutes) for failed and deferred; 'later' (24 hours) for disabled.",
    "A card with a meaning is queued for context only when it is not pinned, has a source sentence, is in the user wordbook, its source is not llm_context, and no attempt for this lemma and sentence is still in effect."
  ]
}
